It is done, and submitted. You can play “Survival in Space” on your web browser right now. I’m currently enjoying playing around with some of its features, but it seems like, overall, it will be a good source of entertainment during this pandemic lockdown period.

If you want to play Survival in Space on your browser here is a direct link https://space-survival.herokuapp.com/, it will give you a live version running as a Heroku instance.

Enjoy.

